cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PINNeAPPle in your research, please cite it."
title: "PINNeAPPle"
abstract: >-
  PINNeAPPle is an open-source Python platform for physics-informed machine
  learning: PINNs, neural operators, graph networks and classical solvers under
  one problem description, with physics-based checks of every prediction.
